      "purpose": "Expose the bandwidth-versus-local-support trade-off; do not select bandwidth on the test set."
    }
  ],
  "claim_ceiling": "Synthetic weighting and support diagnostics only. Gaussian proximity is not a density ratio; no finite-sample spatial coverage, conditional validity, field transfer or superiority claim is established."
}
